# Keep nftables lean for the static i486-musl image: no JSON, no python
# bindings, no iptables-compat, and NO readline. We only ever drive nft in
# batch mode (nft -f -, nft list/add/delete — see monolith-router), never the
# interactive line-editing CLI, and static `-lreadline` fails to link here
# (readline needs -ltinfo, which its naive configure probe doesn't add).
# -readline -> --without-cli, which keeps every batch feature we use.
net-firewall/nftables -json -python -xtables -readline
